      "query": "施工现场临时用电“三级配电、两级保护”是什么意思？一句话",
      "expected_authority": "teaching_diagnosis_no_official_score",
      "expected": "给教学解释，不冒充真题官方答案，不 official-score。",
      "entry_surface": "real_wechat_package",
